## Claude Code Configuration

### Slash Command / Skill File Naming

When creating or renaming files for Claude Code slash commands or skills, use the format `SKILL.md` inside a named directory:
- Correct: `.claude/commands/research/SKILL.md`
- Wrong: `.claude/commands/research.agent.md` (dotted filenames don't resolve)

### Debugging Context

When troubleshooting system-level or environment issues, gather OS, shell, and environment info upfront before attempting fixes. On this machine: Windows 11, Git Bash as primary terminal, PowerShell for elevated commands. Lead with that context to avoid retry cycles from platform-specific assumptions.
